                                        "entry_id": "efd1e327-b575-3ca1-bc21-606acf897ef9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An animal from the subtribe Bubalina, also known as true buffalos, such as the Cape buffalo, Syncerus caffer, or the water buffalo, Bubalus bubalis."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f790580c-1983-4fd8-b793-f5f5b8567fb1",
                                                "sense_id": "a52ce862-2340-38b5-8a72-5b9529d7e8fa",
                                                "text": "\"It must be a very wild stretch of country, and full of big game. I have always wanted to kill a buffalo before I die.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1aac9a6-e1dd-4874-980e-a26ed2eac0d1",
                                                "sense_id": "a52ce862-2340-38b5-8a72-5b9529d7e8fa",
                                                "text": "And on this board were frightful swords and knives that are made in a great cavern by swinking demons out of white flames that they fix in the horns of buffalos and stags that there abound marvellously."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6788705c-b5ff-4510-9758-921c3a8f0491",
                                                "sense_id": "a52ce862-2340-38b5-8a72-5b9529d7e8fa",
                                                "text": "From the Indians who welcomed the pilgrims / And to the buffaloes who once ruled the plain / Like the vultures / Circling beneath the dark clouds / Looking for the rain / Well, they've been looking for the rain"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "513fccfa-65ad-4ba0-82e8-be58e6c66648",
                                                "sense_id": "a52ce862-2340-38b5-8a72-5b9529d7e8fa",
                                                "text": "The feuds between Namsang and Borduria continued. In 1875-76 the dispute between the Namsang and Borduria arose about the buffaloes which were carried off by Borduria people from Namsang areas."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "500f9b26-c6fb-37eb-a169-ad8efe6eb0c3",
                                        "entry_id": "efd1e327-b575-3ca1-bc21-606acf897ef9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A related North American animal, the American bison, Bison bison."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
